<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Invitation - Template system</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
    <h1>Welcome!</h1>
    <p>You have been invited to the Template system.</p>
    <p>Click the link below to finalize your registration:</p>
    <p style="margin: 30px 0;">
        <a href="{{ model.SetupLink }}"
           style="background-color: #007bff; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block;">
            Complete registration
        </a>
    </p>
    <p style="color: #666; font-size: 14px;">
        If you did not request this invitation, please ignore this message.
    </p>
</body>
</html>
